      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Credit is a risk",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 26,
          "startingLine": 1655
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Credit involves borrowing money that must be repaid with interest and fees. Taking on credit can affect your financial stability, and missed or late payments may lead to additional charges, collection actions, and negative impacts on your creditworthiness. Changes in income, unexpected expenses, or higher interest costs can increase the risk of not meeting payment obligations. Always ensure you understand the total cost, repayment schedule, and consequences of non-payment before proceeding.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 26,
          "startingLine": 1659
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "By proceeding, you acknowledge that:\n• You are responsible for repaying the credit according to the terms.\n• Charges, interest, and fees may apply if payments are late or missed.\n• Your bank or lender may decline or reverse the transaction if conditions are not met.\n• Failing to repay may impact your ability to obtain credit in the future.",
        "location": {
          "startingColumn": 26,
          "startingLine": 1666
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "I understand",
        "location": {
